stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle: Show quiet vendors
  Loading: Loading with Hide available
  Refused: Unavailable alert with Refresh and Hide
  Ready: Five vendors per page or valid empty message
  Hidden: Show quiet vendors with retained result
  Disposed: Panel removed
  Idle --> Loading: Show
  Loading --> Loading: Repeated Show or Refresh ignored
  Loading --> Ready: Complete valid snapshot
  Loading --> Refused: Malformed snapshot or rejected read
  Refused --> Loading: Refresh
  Ready --> Loading: Refresh
  Ready --> Ready: Next or Previous bounded page
  Ready --> Hidden: Hide and focus Show
  Refused --> Hidden: Hide and focus Show
  Loading --> Hidden: Hide and focus Show
  Hidden --> Ready: Reopen retained valid result
  Hidden --> Refused: Reopen retained refusal
  Hidden --> Loading: Reopen pending read
  Loading --> Disposed: Dispose
  Ready --> Disposed: Dispose
  Refused --> Disposed: Dispose
  Disposed --> Disposed: Late read ignored
  %% never Show an empty-list message for rejected data.
  %% never Start a second load while one is pending.
  %% never Render after disposal.
